    "long_instructions": "# Explore University Rankings\r\n\r\nBuild a program that loads and explores the `university_rankings.csv` dataset.\r\n\r\n## Build Your Program\r\n\r\nYour program must:\r\n\r\n* Import pandas\r\n* Read `university_rankings.csv` into a DataFrame\r\n* Print the DataFrame’s shape and length\r\n* Print the first and last five rows\r\n\r\nRun your program and fix any errors.\r\n\r\n::: details [Need help? Ask AI Tutor]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor for a hint, an explanation, or help fixing an error.\r\n\r\n:::\r\n\r\n::: details [Extra Challenge]\r\n\r\nPrint the first 10 rows and the last three rows.\r\n\r\n:::",
